{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_12_level_main_12-18_beg","groupId":"main_12","stageId":"main_12-18","title":"誠摯邀請","storyCode":"12-20","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_12-18_beg.txt","sourceHash":"99296b8507a3d83aab679441dfc9617a07c73678b0d7e9622fad5905c50c9a01","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"曼弗雷德用飛空艇做誘餌消滅大公爵主力的計劃破產。W和赫德雷救下了跳船的伊內絲，三人再次團聚。而變形者集群也找上了阿米婭。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g11_hispdwarshipdeck"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫德米爾公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫德米爾公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老威靈頓幾乎把他所有的預備戰艦都派過來了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，公爵閣下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"威靈頓公爵似乎對那艘船......勢在必得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們的前鋒部隊應該已經與薩卡茲交火了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫德米爾公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，還有開斯特......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫德米爾公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那女人幾乎從來不走出她的防區，這次連她都坐不住了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫德米爾公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這艘會飛的小船到底有多吸引人，值得他們這麼大費周章？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......您的參謀們同樣建議您盡可能地獲得那艘飛空艇的技術，公爵閣下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論是抗衡薩卡茲，還是將來面對......其他可能的對手，這種前所未有的武器都能為我們爭取到更多的空間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫德米爾公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓他們閉嘴。什麼可能的對手？他們這是在教唆我分裂維多利亞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫德米爾公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我來這裡只是為了接戴菲恩回家的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"參謀們說，諾伯特區的情況，可能會很糟糕......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫德米爾公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戴菲恩不會有事，她可是我的女兒。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"公、公爵閣下......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫德米爾公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒告訴過你們嗎？不允許在艦內奔跑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"您看，那個移動地塊的影子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"好像......有些不太對......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"溫德米爾公爵接過副官遞給自己的望遠鏡。\n被朝陽拉長的地塊影子中，投影出的卻不是諾伯特區的樣貌。\n是因為建築物的遮擋嗎？溫德米爾思考著，是有些奇怪，像是一座塔。\n塔？\n還是......大廈？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫德米爾公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那是......碎片大廈的影子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫德米爾公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼可能？這是一種自然現象嗎？還是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫德米爾公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你剛才說，開斯特和威靈頓的部隊還有多久能抵達這附近？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恐怕不會超過兩個小時......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是難得，三位公爵的軍隊，居然一起出現在這個地塊附近......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"據我們的參謀報告，其他幾位大公爵也同樣在蠢蠢欲動，他們要是真開動自己的戰艦出現在這裡也並不奇怪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在部隊待了這麼多年，還從沒遇上過這樣的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫德米爾公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫德米爾公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"停船！所有部隊馬上停下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫德米爾公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓他們馬上撤出這個地塊附近！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫德米爾公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"發射紅色信號彈，警告友軍！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫德米爾公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快！快！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫德米爾公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"發送明碼電文，通告周圍的所有維多利亞部隊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫德米爾公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡可能會成為碎片大廈的攻擊地點！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好、好的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫德米爾公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這艘船不要轉向，向諾伯特區加速行進！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫德米爾公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_868_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我得在那風暴形成之前，找到戴菲恩！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"37_g9_airshipdockcorridor"},{"type":"narration","text":"一朵朵紅色信號彈在雲層之下炸起，扭曲的地塊陰影正在變回原狀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很出色，伊內絲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是一次並非全功率的試射，我們有很多可以選擇的地點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過我不得不承認，有一些小小的可惜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但軍事委員會的計劃目標，從來就不止一個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告訴食腐者之王閣下，準備進軍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"風暴會為他開路。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"伊內絲常常提起，死亡也是工具。\n她有時會向赫德雷自嘲，自己可能已經習慣死人的身份了。\n不過等到死亡真的來臨，伊內絲發現，自己比想像的要平靜得多。\n她閉上了眼睛。\n猛然，火光與熱量撲面而來，伴隨著的，還有強烈的衝擊波。\n這種炸藥的味道，伊內絲很熟悉。\n她扯起嘴角。\n爆炸的塵煙撲面而來，餘燼仍然帶著火的溫度。\n這些餘燼在聚集，在飄舞，在編織。\n薩卡茲的歷史由餘燼織就，但有的時候，這些塵埃也能編織出些別的東西。\n比如......\n伊內絲栽入一團輕柔的煙塵之中。\n餘燼形成的巨網托住了她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不該覺得......他們兩個能有什麼好主意的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"37_g10_wildbattlefield"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，伊內絲，還活著嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這種爆炸的難度很高，搞出什麼意外也不奇怪啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫德雷，算了，直接埋了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......真是抱歉，姑且活著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，掃興。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，喜歡我給你放的煙火嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"猜猜我偷偷在你的衣服裡面縫上過什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇！誰能想到，是個定位器耶！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你以為我沒發現嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼粗的針腳，說真的，你的縫補手藝真夠差的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁，原本是為了給你點真正的“驚喜”的，不過，好吧，這樣也行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有這些——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們知不知道在戰場上保持衣服乾淨整潔有多不容易。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們居然就這麼把我丟進了一團燒著的灰裡面？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你以前還會形容我的源石技藝叫餘燼呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在沒這個心情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你傷得不輕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總比死了強。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼！赫德雷！你居然會用源石技藝嗎？我還以為你只會用刀砍人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"餘燼？怪不得我每次把炸彈扔你臉上你都好像沒什麼事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你是不是不怕被炮打啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怕。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"37_i08"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那你是不是可以用灰揚別人一臉啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你老是把自己弄得灰頭土臉，是不是這個源石技藝的副作用啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"閉嘴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我已經多少年沒看過你這麼狼狽的樣子了，伊內絲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"相信我，你以後也不會再看到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別對自己的運氣太有自信，搞不好回去的路上就撞上血魔大君在散步呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"W，我建議你換個比諭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼，在曼弗雷德身邊待了那麼長時間，對王庭裡那些老怪物有感情了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喂，你該謝謝我！要不是我回來的路上遇到了遍地亂竄的你，說不定你已經又被你其他的老朋友抓走了呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......你真的很吵，我寧願回監獄裡去，至少安靜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"請回，我可以主動向特雷西斯舉報你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"現在我們去哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"W的安全屋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，我可以勉強當做是回家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"還有——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......謝謝。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_battlefield"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我要回去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她今天的腿腳怎麼那麼慢？是走路的時候摔傷了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們得去幫她一把，等把她接出來，這種救命之恩，肯定夠薛她幾瓶好酒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"愣著幹嘛，走啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行了，漢娜！諾伯特區如今是一片火海！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"貝爾德又不是蠢蛋，她會躲著火走的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......她死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說什麼？摩根，這不是開玩笑的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我說了！貝爾德死了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你沒看到那把蝴蝶刀嗎，那把沾著血的蝴蝶刀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是貝爾德從不離身的武器，不會有錯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如今，這把刀在另一個人手裡，這就意味著......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說不定只是個誤會，說不定是貝爾德不小心把她的刀弄丟了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她也會有粗心的時候，對吧？她也不是沒搞丟過東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當年，她搞丟了我們一打羽獸蛋，記得嗎？本來我們早上是有煎蛋吃的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她偶爾會大意一下，這沒什麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"漢娜......麥克拉倫拿著那把刀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"貝爾德最後就是去找他的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他聾了兩隻耳朵，大概是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈！貝爾德和麥克拉倫多少年的交情了，你們是不是又在嚇我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"貝爾德就是把她的刀借給了麥克拉倫用一下嘛，沒什麼大不了的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我們可以問問他情況，他也許會告訴我們，這只是個......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"漢娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他人在哪？麥克拉倫和我們一起離開諾伯特區了，對吧？那就一定在這些人裡面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"問一下，不就能解開誤會了嘛......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麥克拉倫——你在哪——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麥克拉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......漢娜，他聽不見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要殺了他！！！我要殺了那個混帳！！！我要把他找出來，抽出他的每塊骨頭！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"漢娜！......行了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"維娜！你*維多利亞粗口*是不是早就知道？！你為什麼不去——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我為什麼不去敲碎他的腦袋為貝爾德報仇？！你以為我不想嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你以為我不想嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為這*維多利亞粗口*沒意義！幹掉一個嚇瘋了的聾子沒有一點意義！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"漢娜，我恨透了這些，我恨透了這些東西，我是個徹頭徹尾的蠢貨，自以為是的傻瓜！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿勒黛，貝爾德......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我不參與這些事，她們也許就不會......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我到底是為了什麼回來？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以為我是為了什麼回來？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"這是不是......從一開始，就是個因為虛假的責任心而犯下的錯誤？\n自己內心中怎麼看待她們，看待這些曾一起出生入死，一起歷盡磨難的友人？\n是不是......這份她無比珍視的“友情”，其實不過是個連自己都騙過了的說辭？\n是不是，就連自己，都開始漸漸地把自己看作是一位國王？\n賞賜慈悲，播撒仁義......然後，收取希望與敬仰。\n自己到底......想成為什麼？\n自己到底期待成為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......維娜，我們回來，是因為我們沒有辦法忍受......只是在一邊旁觀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為這是我們的街道，我們的區塊，我們的國家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你總是衝鋒在前，但這不是你的責任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們跟在你身後，也不是因為期待你成為怎樣的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"維娜，你只是我們的維娜，對吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......當然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只會是維娜，我發誓。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_battlefield"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們需要把這些諾伯特區的市民帶去哪裡？總不能讓他們在荒野上自生自滅吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"更何況，這裡是戰場的中心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......如果這些市民願意的話，他們可以去我母親的領地裡生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"母親她開了一座移動城市到倫蒂尼姆附近，雖然只是小型的要塞城市，但安置這些人還是沒問題的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡鐸爾，你有什麼想法嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戴菲恩，你發現了嗎，自從你開始不再掩飾自己的身份，你說話的口氣都變了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道貝爾德的事......讓你很難過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們都很難過，但你不需要在這個時候讓大家的心情變得更糟糕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，總算找到人了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"變形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請問，能為我們倒杯水嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"變形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那條德拉克......我們不喜歡她的那些火，燒在身上難滅得很。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......變形者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"變形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿斯卡綸，我們有日子沒見了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你來這裡幹什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"變形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"找水喝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"變形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"順便來正式和我們的這位小魔王打個招呼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"變形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那位女妖可是誇了你不少呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"阿米婭，後退。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事的，博士，雖然我從來沒有見過這位客人現在的樣貌......但我對他們很熟悉，他們在那些歷史中出現了很多次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是他們總是游離在王庭之外，對除了自身之外的一切都......缺乏興趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"變形者的碎片，你為什麼出現在我們面前？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"變形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來你確實是貨真價實的魔王，小兔子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"變形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那東西把你也折磨得不輕。你不是薩卡茲，真佩服你的小腦袋裡能裝下那麼多的東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"變形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"記憶，我們最寶貴的東西，但有時候也會是我們的毒藥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"變形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，我們似乎還是能有些共同話題的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您......是不是也覺得我不配承載“魔王”這頂冠冕？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"變形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來，那隻嘮叨的死魂靈狠狠罵了你一頓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"變形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別理他，他從來不討人喜歡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是一位古老的薩卡茲，您覺得......魔王需要怎麼做？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"變形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，是個好問題。我們沒當過，我們也並不在意......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"變形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我們想，最起碼應該足夠強大？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"變形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"強大到......足夠跨越所有的猶豫和迷茫，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"變形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但有一點我們十分確定，你不該向我們提出這個問題，小魔王。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"變形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還有很長的路要走。無論是繼續領著那個叫羅德島的組織打打鬧鬧，還是遵從薩卡茲眾魂的指引。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"變形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，抱歉，我們忘了，薩卡茲眾魂不會接納你，就像不會接納我們一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"變形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們都是異類。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"變形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"變形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你總會在未來的某一刻明白，你是無法戰勝時間的。我們的記憶中，每一任的魔王總會在最後走上同一條道路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......但那不會是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我——拒絕走上那條道路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"變形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先不要急著否定我們，卡特斯。我們也曾以為另一位年輕的魔王會給我們驚喜，但似乎你們的命運依舊牢不可破。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"變形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我們依然對你充滿了期待，一位不是薩卡茲的魔王......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"變形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一位仍然不斷成長且質疑自己血脈的年輕魔王......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"變形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一位我們都從未見過的魔王......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你想幹什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"變形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們......並無惡意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"變形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"魔王，我們不敢宣揚我們比你更加具有智慧，我們也無法教會你任何事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"變形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們只是想要發出一個邀請，請求一個能夠深入瞭解這樣一個......“唯一”個體的機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"變形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿斯卡綸，你要是和我們活得一樣長，你就會明白的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"變形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當你眼前出現了一個從未見過的東西，怎麼可能忍住不去碰碰看呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"變形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尊敬的魔王，請給我們漫長的生命一次驚喜。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
